  (text "All connector pin orders are PROJECT-DEFINED. Cable by signal names, not by assuming module pin order."
    (at 15 17 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.2 1.2)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid 512878c4-afaf-57f4-b3b9-f828034631fc)
  )
  (text "A1: 2x22 YD socket; V1.5 pad audit and mechanical fit pending. GPIO1 and PSRAM-reserved GPIO35/36/37 NC."
    (at 15 153 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.1 1.1)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid 533af713-a092-5ef3-9e67-a8b5b2e35756)
  )
  (text "JP1: remove external 5V link for USB power. JP2/JP3: NO SHUNT until ToF VIN/pull-up voltage verified."
    (at 15 260 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.2 1.2)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid a028aa30-ba70-5b0f-92a2-d07d775cf5ee)
  )
  (text "K1 and K2 modules remain external. J8 is 24V DC relay COM/NO only. NO 110V, N or PE on this PCB."
    (at 15 267 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.2 1.2)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid a482fbc1-0dec-518c-a253-a699d44fea14)
  )
  (text "Q2: verify E/B/C before assembly. D1 band K to switched motor+. Existing D-50B 24V/1A startup capacity unverified."
    (at 15 274 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.1 1.1)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
